  "body": "\n`fs.ts:pickFolder()`:\n\n1. `window.showDirectoryPicker({mode: \"read\"})` → directory handle.\n2. Persist handle to IDB under `fsa:handle:<id>`.\n3. `walkDirectory(handle)` → list of supported file entries.\n4. Register session handles via `sessionHandles.register(…)`.\n5. `useLibrary.addFolder(folder, files)` with `kind: \"fsa\"`.\n\n",
